@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Health check - public endpoint (no auth required)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health


### 2. Try to access tickets without token - should return 401 Unauthorized
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets


### 3. Register a normal user with USER role
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Normal User",
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "User@12345"
}


### 4. Login normal user - copy token from response
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "User@12345"
}


### 5. Get tickets with USER token - should return 200 OK
### Replace PASTE_USER_TOKEN_HERE with token from login/register response
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_USER_TOKEN_HERE


### 6. Try to create ticket with USER token - should return 403 Forbidden
### Replace PASTE_USER_TOKEN_HERE with token from login/register response
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_USER_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test Ticket",
  "description": "This is a test ticket",
  "status": "OPEN"
}


### 7. Login seeded admin user - copy token from response
### Seeded admin credentials: admin@example.com / Admin@12345
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "Admin@12345"
}


### 8. Create ticket with ADMIN token - should return 201 Created
### Replace PASTE_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE with token from admin login response
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Admin Created Ticket",
  "description": "This ticket was created by an admin",
  "status": "OPEN"
}


### 9. Get tickets with ADMIN token - should return 200 OK
### Replace PASTE_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE with token from admin login response
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE


### 10. Get specific ticket by ID with ADMIN token - should return 200 OK
### Replace PASTE_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE with token from admin login response
### Replace TICKET_ID with actual ticket ID from create response
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tickets/TICKET_ID
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE
